10
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
To All the Boys I've Loved Before is a 2018 American teen romantic comedy
film directed by Susan Johnson and written by Sofia Alvarez.

11
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
The film stars Lana Condor, Noah Centineo, Janel Parrish, Anna Cathcart,
Madeleine Arthur, Emilija Baranac, Israel Broussard and John Corbett.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The movie is based on Jenny Han's 2014 novel of the same name,
and was released by Netflix on August 17, 2018.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
It received positive reviews from critics, who praised the cast.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
It has been the first installment in what is now
the To All the Boys film series.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
It was followed by two sequels, To All the Boys: P.S.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
I Still Love You, released on February 12, 2020, and To All the
Boys: Always and Forever on February 12, 2021.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
A spin-off series titled XO, Kitty was released on May 18, 2023.

18
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The film explores themes of high school, based on novel or
book, love letter, romance, first love.

19
01:35:00,000 --> 01:35:06,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
